      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 3.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.61,
      "end_seconds": 8.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Hello. I hope I'm not late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.51,
      "end_seconds": 17.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "doctor, um, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.92,
      "end_seconds": 27.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 28.12,
      "end_seconds": 34.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, we came because of light vaginal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.37,
      "end_seconds": 39.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.91,
      "end_seconds": 47.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "For ten days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.96,
      "end_seconds": 51.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.22,
      "end_seconds": 60.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Erm, um, when it starts I tend to get shoulder tip pain as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.94,
      "end_seconds": 69.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.88,
      "end_seconds": 83.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.78,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. Ah, I've also been feeling faint. With feeling faint, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. It comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.1,
      "end_seconds": 90.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "So, have you had light vaginal bleeding before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.74,
      "end_seconds": 98.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Actually, a bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.54,
      "end_seconds": 102.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Okay, did you get fever or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.38,
      "end_seconds": 109.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "No, you know, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.97,
      "end_seconds": 112.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.78,
      "end_seconds": 114.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.63,
      "end_seconds": 119.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.93,
      "end_seconds": 122.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.83,
      "end_seconds": 128.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Alright, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.96,
      "end_seconds": 134.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Okay, so no, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.19,
      "end_seconds": 137.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "So, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.01,
      "end_seconds": 142.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Oh, uh, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.66,
      "end_seconds": 147.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.45,
      "end_seconds": 155.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.99,
      "end_seconds": 158.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.9,
      "end_seconds": 166.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.5,
      "end_seconds": 172.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.27,
      "end_seconds": 176.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.16,
      "end_seconds": 193.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.39,
      "end_seconds": 208.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.66,
      "text": "okay: pressure 127 over 71, weight 71 kilos, temperature 36.6. And height 151 centimetres, pulse 116, BMI works out to 31.1."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.62,
      "end_seconds": 266.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "Listening to the whole story, it's hard to say. A possible ectopic pregnancy is one possibility and a ruptured ovarian cyst another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.57,
      "end_seconds": 270.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.49,
      "end_seconds": 279.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible ectopic pregnancy, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.63,
      "end_seconds": 303.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.41,
      "text": "I want an urgent pelvic scan done, that's for possible ectopic. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.51,
      "end_seconds": 305.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.42,
      "end_seconds": 327.99,
      "duration_seconds": 20.57,
      "text": "You need to go to the hospital now for an emergency scan. The thing that would worry me is if the pain gets worse or you faint. If that happens, go to emergency. Come back straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.71,
      "end_seconds": 331.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
